{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49078","headline":"阳台梦 · 後唐庄宗","name":"阳台梦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薄罗衫子金泥缝，困纤腰怯铢衣重。\n笑迎移步小兰丛，嚲金翘玉凤。\n娇多情脉脉，羞把同心捻弄。\n楚天云雨却相和，又入阳台梦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後唐庄宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}